  "description": {
    "en": "Babolat RPM Soft is a unique polyamide monofilament designed to bridge the gap between multifilament comfort and monofilament durability. Its flexible polyamide construction provides significantly more comfort than traditional polyester strings, while its monofilament structure and double aramid coating improve durability compared with standard multifilaments. It is especially suitable for players transitioning into monofilament strings or those who want more spin and durability without the stiffness of polyester.",

    "zh": "Babolat RPM Soft 是一款非常特别的聚酰胺单丝球线，定位介于传统多芯线与聚酯单丝之间。聚酰胺材质比聚酯和共聚酯更柔软、更有弹性，因此拥有非常出色的舒适性；同时单丝结构和双层芳纶涂层又让它比普通多芯线更加耐用。它非常适合第一次从多芯线过渡到单丝球线的球员，或者希望获得更多旋转与耐久表现、但又不想承受传统聚酯线硬度的使用者。"
  },

